310	     *
311	     * Accepts flexible formats like 'MP-1', 'MP-01', 'MP-001' and
312	     * normalises them to the canonical 4-digit padded form 'MP-0001'.
313	     * This ensures consistent URLs for SEO and caching.
314	     *
315	     * @param {string} id Song ID in any format (e.g., 'MP-1', 'mp-01')
