+
+        /* -----------------------------------------------------------------
+         * Get all available IETF BCP 47 language variants (#738)
+         *
+         * Same shape as `action=scripts` / `action=regions` for
+         * tblLanguageVariants — IANA variant subtags (5-8 chars,
